# /etc/pigeonpost-buildd/scandb-allowlist.txt — the only names the scanner updater (user nestscan)
# may reach on TCP 443. Nothing here is reachable by nestbuild, by a build, or by a scan.
#
# OSV mirror (osv-scanner's offline databases). Google front ends: the set follows the resolved
# addresses every minute, and those addresses also serve other Google storage, which is why only
# the updater (no publisher code) has this list.
osv-vulnerabilities.storage.googleapis.com
# Grype's database listing and archives.
grype.anchore.io
# ClamAV signatures (freshclam).
database.clamav.net
# The YARA-Forge release (github.com redirects the download to the release-assets host).
github.com
objects.githubusercontent.com
release-assets.githubusercontent.com
